<title>SWITZERLAND: Roche 1996 net profit up 16 percent.</title>
<headline>Roche 1996 net profit up 16 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996.</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net			3,899	     vs 3,372</p>
<p> Dividend (Sfr)		 75		  vs 64</p>
<p> Turnover			 15,966	    vs 14,426</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Swiss pharmaceuticals group is Roche Holding AG. Analysts had forecast a 17.6 percent rise in 1996 profit to 3.97 billion francs.</p>
<p>Roche had earlier reported an initial turnover figure for 1996 of 15,961 million Swiss francs.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
